i-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">What kind of pictures?</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/e/ef/What_kind_of_pictures%3F.png/revision/latest?cb=20210210192912\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"What kind of pictures?\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/e/ef/What_kind_of_pictures%3F.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210210192912\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/e/ef/What_kind_of_pictures%3F.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210210192912 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/e/ef/What_kind_of_pictures%3F.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210210192912 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"What kind of pictures?\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"What_kind_of_pictures%3F.png\" data-image-name=\"What kind of pictures?.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_6\" title=\"Series 6\">6</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Russell_Howard\" title=\"Russell Howard\">Russell Howard</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Roadkill_doused_in_syrup.\" title=\"Roadkill doused in syrup.\">Roadkill doused in syrup.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Bubble_Brothers.\" title=\"The Bubble Brothers.\">The Bubble Brothers.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>What kind of pictures?</b></i> is the eighth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_6\" title=\"Series 6\">Series 6</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 20 June 2018. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Russell_Howard\" title=\"Russell Howard\">Russell Howard</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/What_kind_of_pictures%3F?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"What kind of pictures?\" was how <a href=\"/wiki/Liza_Tarbuck\" title=\"Liza Tarbuck\">Liza Tarbuck</a> responded to Alex's question about whether he'd be able to find any pictures of her wearing purple, in the <a href=\"/wiki/Find_out_what_you_have_in_common_with_this_person\" title=\"Find out what you have in common with this person\">Find out what you have in common with this person</a> task. The fly in an egg shown in the title card is a reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Put_something_genuinely_surprising_inside_this_chocolate_egg\" title=\"Put something genuinely surprising inside this chocolate egg\">Put something genuinely surprising inside this chocolate egg</a> task, specifically <a href=\"/wiki/Tim_Vine\" title=\"Tim Vine\">Tim Vine</a>'s attempt, where he put a fly in the egg.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/What_kind_of_pictures%3F?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Hvilken slags billeder?', which translates as 'What kind of pictures?'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Millaisia kuvia?', which translates as 'What kind of pictures?'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Hva slags bilde er det?', which translates as 'What kind of picture is that?'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/What_kind_of_pictures%3F?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Alice_Levine\" title=\"Alice Levine\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Alice Levine</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Asim_Chaudhry\" title=\"Asim Chaudhry\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Asim Chaudhry</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Liza_Tarbuck\" title=\"Liza Tarbuck\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Liza Tarbuck</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Russell_Howard\" title=\"Russell Howard\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Russell Howard</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Tim_Vine\" title=\"Tim Vine\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Tim Vine</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Most_interesting_footwear\" title=\"Most interesting footwear\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Most interesting footwear.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Put_something_genuinely_surprising_inside_this_chocolate_egg\" title=\"Put something genuinely surprising inside this chocolate egg\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Put something genuinely surprising inside this chocolate egg.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Find_out_what_you_have_in_common_with_this_person\" title=\"Find out what you have in common with this person\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Find out what you have in common with this person. You must look the person in the eye throughout the task and shake hands every time you discover you have in common.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Wearing_these_high_heels,_create_the_best_dot-to-dot_picture_on_this_canvas\" title=\"Wearing these high heels, create the best dot-to-dot picture on this canvas\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Wearing these high heels, create the best dot-to-dot picture on this canvas.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Stick_a_plaster_to_the_correct_body_part\" title=\"Stick a plaster to the correct body part\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Stick a plaster to the correct body part. Alex will say the names of three body parts. You must stick a plaster to the body part that comes second in the dictionary out of the three body parts. The slowest person to stick a plaster to the correct body part is eliminated.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Receive_a_text_message_as_fast_as_possible\" title=\"Receive a text message as fast as possible\">T</a>\n</td>\n<td>Receive a text message as fast as possible.\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td>✘\n</td>\n<td><b>✔</b>\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">17\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https: